        Contains / RecordIds / Count require Read. (2) Both strategies build the principal through
        CallerPrincipal.FromReadBearing; HasProjectAccess, GetAccessibleProjectIds, Accessible*Ids and the new
        ReadableProjects require Read on their own. (3) The seven project read routes test Read through
        HoldsReadOnProject (RightsForRoot, the to-do list's expression); GET /projects lists Read-bearing ids only;
        the content download still denies before any SPE pointer resolution. /me returns readable projects only and
        never emits "None". Mutating routes unchanged (Read-gated HasProjectAccess, then Create). ExternalCallerContext
        aligned. ExternalParticipationService: comment only (owner decision recorded; grant query unchanged).
        ExternalAccessModule.cs / ExternalModuleRegistry.cs not edited.
